# Licence and third-party notices

This repository holds several kinds of material with **different and incompatible
terms**. There is no single licence covering all of it, and this file does not
attempt to impose one.

| Part of the repository | Terms |
| --- | --- |
| Code (`tools/`, `research/mistranslations/tools/`) | MIT — see §1 |
| Curated research data (`research/mistranslations/*.json`, `versions.json`) | CC BY 4.0 — see §1 |
| Lexical data (`lexicon/`) | Third-party. **Includes CC BY-SA** — see §2 |
| Bible texts (`versions/`, `apocrypha-versions/`) | Mixed, per text. **Some are under active copyright and are not licensed by this file** — see §3 and §4 |

---

